  "id": "self-affirmation",
  "term": "self-affirmation",
  "definition": "Self-affirmation is a psychological exercise in which a person focuses on valued personal qualities or important values about themselves. In this study, using self-affirmation before a socially excluding situation was associated with less hostile interpretation of the situation.",
